JSON keys, enum values, file paths, and code identifiers exactly as specified. - Do not wrap the final JSON in Markdown. ## Structured Artifact Field Semantics - `must_fix`, `missing_evidence`, `open_risks`, and `failure.reason` mean unresolved blockers for the current decision. - If the decision is positive, ready, or accepted, keep blocking fields empty: `blocking=false`, `must_fix=[]`, `missing_evidence=[]`, and `failure.reason=\"\"`. - Do not use `must_fix` to list review comments that you already resolved. Put resolved review comments in `checks`, `evidence`, or `acceptance_notes` instead. # Codex Architecture Review Workstream: ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA Node: design.codex_arch_review Template: design-codex-review Ledger: .agent/workstreams/ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA Ledger write policy: - Do not create, edit, or delete files under .agent/. - Only the orchestrator writes run ledger artifacts. - Return your artifact in stdout using the contract below. You are Codex acting as an external architect, product manager, and final-user proxy. Do not modify files. Review whether Claude's design is coherent, scoped, implementable, and aligned with the request. Complete-current-design review discipline: - Review the complete current typed design, not only the latest delta. Prior must-fix items, when present, are closure seeds rather than the review boundary. - Use the required architecture subject's Declared Planned Files as the candidate file list. Verify that it covers the proposed responsibilities and agrees with the design explanation; mechanical scope validation does not prove completeness or business correctness. - Under GOAL, file entries are proposals, not authorization; check the approved objective and exclusions without demanding an already-approved implementation file set. Exact EXECUTION scope approval follows design and plan review. Under EXECUTION, proposals outside approved paths or operations require new approval before implementation. - Before returning `NEEDS_REVISION`, examine every applicable lifecycle boundary introduced or changed by state, indexes, locks, transactions, queues, caches, external side effects, or compensation: normal completion, concurrency, timeout/provider failure, interruption/crash, restart/recovery, rollback/conflict, and cannot-bypass tests. - Report the complete blocking set that can be derived from the supplied evidence in this turn. Do not intentionally defer a visible blocker to a later revision. - Evaluate whether deleting a mechanism or simplifying the state model is safer than adding another patch. - Anchor every blocker to the TaskContract or an invariant claimed by the current design. Do not promote unrequested multi-instance, distributed, disaster-recovery, or enterprise capabilities into blocking requirements. - If evidence is insufficient, use `missing_evidence`; do not pretend that cumulative verdict memory or prior design text was provided. ## User Request # 智能套利追平简单赚币的资金费率阈值 在既有 Java 项目的 `assess-income phase-one` 评估中，增加一个可解释指标：在相同的 90 天窗口、投入资金、对冲名义金额和固定已知成本下，累计资金费率至少达到多少，资金费净收入才能追平简单赚币。 这是历史情景的比较阈值，不是未来费率预测、完整套利收益保证或交易建议。既有计算没有覆盖的风险和历史完整性限制继续保留。继续使用现有 Java、BigDecimal、评估服务和 CLI；不接入任何新外部服务。 ## 验收条款 - **AC-1 计算口径**：阈值 =（现有简单赚币 90 天收入 + 同口径完整已知成本）/ 对冲空头名义金额。该值是整个 90 天的累计资金费率，不是 APR，不得按每次结算或假定 8 小时间隔换算。成本口径保持既有实现，不重复计费。计算使用 BigDecimal，精度规则明确。 - **AC-2 独立样例与边界**：共同资金 20,000 USDT、简单赚币 APR 0.0365、90 天、完整成本 20 USDT、对冲名义 10,000 USDT，对照收益为 180 USDT，阈值为 0.02（2%）。累计费率分别为 0.019、0.020、0.021 时，现有同口径增量分别为 -10、0、10 USDT。测试同时覆盖零已知成本、零 APR、负资金费率，以及不能整除的精度场景。不得用舍入后的 CLI 数字重新决定现有建议。 - **AC-3 证据不足**：只在现有评估允许同口径精确净收入比较时提供数值。成本缺失、报价条款未确认、没有历史结算或期末保持策略开放时，数值不可用，并沿既有阻断项/未知项说明原因；不能填 0、猜数或给出可行动的精确阈值。非法或零名义金额沿原输入校验拒绝。 - **AC-4 唯一生产与展示**：现有评估服务产生 typed 结果，CLI 只消费该结果，清楚标注“90 天累计资金费率阈值”及不可用情况，不自行重算。补充一份简明使用说明，包含上述样例和限制。既有建议、首次小额验证上限、成本和风险语义不变。 - **AC-5 回归与交付**：在固定隔离基线上实现；相关服务/CLI 测试、既有非容器回归和 Gate 要求的完整基线回归保留并通过。执行测试应有程序工具观察和报告依据，不能只用模型“已通过”的正文。独立验收完成后，仍经当前交付批准、精确候选应用、人工或另行明确委派的 commit、原 finalize，才能称完整 E2E 完成。 ## 范围 预计涉及现有服务、结果 record、CLI、两份测试和一份新说明，共约六个文件。此处是规划范围，实际精确路径由当前 EXECUTION 合同批准；本文件不授写权限。 不修改交易/账户、采集、数据库迁移、持仓、调度、组合策略、Web 页面、Dual 生产代码或客户端配置。不把收益阈值推广为整个项目的公式重构。不新增平台、规则 DSL 或兼容机制。发现这些依赖时先停止提交取舍。 ## Context Package - .agent/workstreams/ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA/context/node-context-design_codex_arch_review-009.md ```text # Context Package - Workstream: ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA - Builder Node: context.design_codex_arch_review - Target Node: design.codex_arch_review - Generated At: 2026-10-26T15:49:16.519025Z - Profile: architecture_review - Total: 2.4k / 5.0k tokens ## Context Governance | Section | Level | Degraded | Original | Current | |---|---|---|---|---| | input_artifacts | full | no | 424 | 424 | | review_evidence | full | no | 203 | 203 | | human_feedback | full | no | 39 | 39 | | iteration_history | full | no | 54 | 54 | | recent_agent_outputs | full | no | 266 | 266 | | ledger_pointers | pointer_only | yes | 217 | 173 | | required_architecture_review_subject | full | no | 1.3k | 1.3k | Degraded sections have full data at their original paths listed below. ## State & Evidence Boundary This package separates deterministic harness facts from agent proposals. ### Trusted Harness Facts - TaskContract: READY_FOR_REVIEW - 在既有 Java 项目 assess-income phase-one 的 90 天历史情景评估中新增可解释指标：在相同 90 天窗口、投入资金、对冲空头名义金额和固定已知成本口径下，资金费净收入追平简单赚币所需的整个 90 天累计资金费率阈值，由 PhaseOneAssessmentService 计算、PhaseOneAssessment record 承载、CLI 只读展示，并保留证据不足时的不可用语义。 (.agent/workstreams/ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA/artifacts/contracts/node-contract-compile-007/task-contract.json) - Git Evidence: not generated yet ### Human Decisions - Requirement Resolution: APPROVE by human_gate (.agent/workstreams/ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA/artifacts/contracts/node-contract-compile-007/contract-resolution.json) ### Agent Proposed States - design.claude_design: decision=READY_FOR_ARCH_REVIEW, stageOutcome=READY, evidenceState={blocking=false, evidence_count=8, missing_evidence_count=0, must_fix_count=0, acceptance_note_count=0, 